<section class="section on-red" id="promise">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="chead rv" style="max-width:calc(860 * var(--px))">
      <h2 class="d2">You tell us where you want to go. We take care of everything in between.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="props">
      <div class="prop rv">
        <span class="prop__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.6 8.4l-2.1 5.1-5.1 2.1 2.1-5.1z"/></svg></span>
        <h3 class="d4">Personalised Planning</h3>
        <p>A journey designed around your group, your interests and your goals, not around a fixed catalogue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prop rv">
        <span class="prop__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M7 14.5h5"/></svg></span>
