      </div>
      <div class="prop rv">
        <span class="prop__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6.2 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 11 7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.4"/></svg></span>
        <h3 class="d4">With You on the Ground</h3>
        <p>A licensed guide and trained crew on every departure, plus a coordinator in Islamabad reachable for the whole journey.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
